OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 8 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Healing Musicians
OL,5,     GKate Kennedy meets principal
OL,6,     GFrench horn player Robin Graham
OL,7,     Gto learn what it means for a
OL,8,     Gmusician's relationship with
OL,9,     Gtheir instrument when injury
OL,10,     Gforces them to stop playing.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GSoweto Kinch presents more of the
OL,19,     Gbest in jazz from the UK and
OL,20,     Garound the world and shares a
OL,21,     Gswinging release from the late
OL,22,     GEnglish jazz singer Beryl Bryden.
